   "value": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000001",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "6xaxawkvvmfj",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Navigate Your Guide to Arrival in "
      },
      {
       "_key": "bofx7zl6g1ku",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "qv9axe94list"
       ],
       "text": "Cairo"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "qv9axe94list",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000003",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Arrival by Air:"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000b",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Cairo, the pulsating heart of Egypt, welcomes travelers through its primary gateway,"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000005"
       ],
       "text": " Cairo International Airport"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". For detailed flight schedules and arrangements, contact the airport at 0900 77777 (landline) or 27777 (mobile) in Egypt. Your air travel to Cairo can be facilitated through "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000008"
       ],
       "text": "Egypt Air"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", with offices conveniently located at Airport Terminal 3 and in the bustling downtown areas of Sharia al-Bustan, Sharia Talaat Harb, and Sharia Adly."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000005",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://www.cairo-airport.com/en-us/",
       "newTab": true
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://www.egyptair.com/en/contact-us/Pages/DomesticOffices.aspx",
       "newTab": true
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Microbus & Service Taxis:"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000015",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For a more localized travel experience, Cairo offers the choice of private taxis or shared vans, commonly known as microbuses. These vehicles connect you to the heart of Cairo and its suburbs. Key pickup locations include the area between Ramses Station and Midan Ulali. For ventures to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000010",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000f"
       ],
       "text": "al-Fayoum"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000011",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and the western oases, head to Moneib, situated on Sharia el-Nil in "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000013",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000012"
       ],
       "text": "Giza"
      },
      {
       "_key": "zlvym1zu2uyz",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", or start from Midan al-Remaya near the iconic "
      },
      {
       "_key": "pjvvwk46dhiz",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "f0358yp45edz"
       ],
       "text": "Giza"
      },
      {
       "_key": "hhsgpiw2tgb4",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Pyramids. Access these points easily via a short walk or taxi ride from the Sakkiat Mekki metro stop."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/al-fayoum-travel-guide/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/guide/al-fayoum",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000012",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/tours/private-tour-pyramids-of-giza-and-sphinx/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/pyramids-of-giza-and-sphinx",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "f0358yp45edz",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000017",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000016",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Bus Travel:"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000022",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000018",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Cairo Gateway (Mina al-Qahira), located near the Orabi metro stop, stands as the central hub for bus travel to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000019"
       ],
       "text": "Alexandria"
      },
      {
       "_key": "ebnnihy0la96",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "2wm9fl8ubwmq",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "na2dkldkbrk1"
       ],
       "text": "Suez"
      },
      {
       "_key": "q6cgawx18e4g",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Canal area, the deserts, Sinai, and "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001c"
       ],
       "text": "Upper Egypt"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Tickets vary by destination and bus company, so plan accordingly. For "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001f"
       ],
       "text": "Suez"
      },
      {
       "_key": "vqm46pv43jlq",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and Sinai, head to the right ticket windows; for "
      },
      {
       "_key": "czm16hmz4xu7",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "m4g6cdweiyd9"
       ],
       "text": "Alexandria"
      },
      {
       "_key": "n9v3kw0ppqoy",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and Upper Egypt, go left. Notable companies include East Delta Travel, West & Mid Delta Bus, Super Jet, and Upper Egypt Travel. Though trains are recommended for destinations like "
      },
      {
       "_key": "l0nto618by70",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "05yfsdd6d90r"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "ixlrxrx8t2jk",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", buses offer a viable alternative. Smaller bus stations, such as Abbassiyya, Abboud, Al-Mazah, and Ulali, provide additional departure times and routes."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000019",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/tours/private-tour-2-day-trip-to-alexandria/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/private-tour-2-day-trip-to-alexandria-from-cairo",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_Egypt",
       "newTab": true
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/suez-travel-guide/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/guide/suez",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "na2dkldkbrk1",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-58938",
